\image(figures/midi_lstm_fit.svg)
// result_end
\caption(The top panel tracks held-out next-event likelihood during fitting. The bottom panel shows each generated note's pitch and duration, with gaps for rests.)
\alttext(Validation negative log likelihood by epoch above a piano roll of the sampled monophonic sequence.)

The likelihood measures how well the model predicts events in these synthetic
motifs. The piano roll shows one sampled continuation. The file uses a single
track at 120 beats per minute and 480 ticks per quarter note.

> Reference

- [MIDI Association, Standard MIDI Files](https://midi.org/standard-midi-files).
